(450850, 42202, 12151, '<td valign="top">A simple and understated visually interesting photo.</td>', 'A simple and understated visually interesting photo.', '2003-10-15 03:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(450852, 41452, 12151, '<td valign="top">Very nice - an uncommonly nonsuperficial photo.  I wish the level of focus was slightly more to the foreground.</td>', 'Very nice - an uncommonly nonsuperficial photo.  I wish the level of focus was slightly more to the foreground.', '2003-10-15 03:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(450854, 41884, 12151, '<td valign="top">This is actually.... a more presentable, clean, startling view of death (roadkill?).  It''s absolutely striking.  This is excellent and sad, and its exact enough to view with a purely scientific eye. This unfortunately probably won\\\''t score high overall because it\\\''s not a postcard photo, but be assured that you\\\''ve done very well to capture a very difficult subject.  You *should* score in the top, even if you don\\\''t.</td>', 'This is actually.... a more presentable, clean, startling view of death (roadkill?).  It''s absolutely striking.  This is excellent and sad, and its exact enough to view with a purely scientific eye. This unfortunately probably won\\\''t score high overall because it\\\''s not a postcard photo, but be assured that you\\\''ve done very well to capture a very difficult subject.  You *should* score in the top, even if you don\\\''t.', '2003-10-15 03:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(450855, 42145, 12151, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color.  The three dark spots in the photo are a little distracting, though, but you can''t (and shouldn''t) touch up nature.</td>', 'Beautiful color.  The three dark spots in the photo are a little distracting, though, but you can''t (and shouldn''t) touch up nature.', '2003-10-15 03:13:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(450856, 42034, 12902, '<td valign="top">Great idea and great shot too. Deserves a 10 and deserves to be on top.</td>', 'Great idea and great shot too. Deserves a 10 and deserves to be on top.', '2003-10-15 03:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(450859, 42035, 12151, '<td valign="top">Very, very good photo, technically.  I wonder about the girl''s expression, though, as she isn''t smiling with her eyes.  It disturbs the mood by adding confusion to the basic atmosphere of innocent curiosity.</td>', 'Very, very good photo, technically.  I wonder about the girl''s expression, though, as she isn''t smiling with her eyes.  It disturbs the mood by adding confusion to the basic atmosphere of innocent curiosity.', '2003-10-15 03:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(450862, 42173, 1647, '<td valign="top">The colours are interesting but I don''t quite understand the purpose of the hand / finger.  Lighting and focus are good though.</td>', 'The colours are interesting but I don''t quite understand the purpose of the hand / finger.  Lighting and focus are good though.', '2003-10-15 03:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(450863, 41978, 12661, '<td valign="top">LOL.  Interesting slide. A black background would have helped the photo though. It would both add contrast and more resemble a typical science class table (or at least the ones at my school)</td>', 'LOL.  Interesting slide. A black background would have helped the photo though. It would both add contrast and more resemble a typical science class table (or at least the ones at my school)', '2003-10-15 03:24:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(450865, 41811, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great composition, great colour and great detail.  The border is my biggest gripe - it''s ok but doesn''t add much to the natural qualities of the image.  Using a plain background was a wonderful choice.</td>', 'Great composition, great colour and great detail.  The border is my biggest gripe - it''s ok but doesn''t add much to the natural qualities of the image.  Using a plain background was a wonderful choice.', '2003-10-15 03:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
