(450888, 41827, 12075, '<td valign="top">wow..this has a huge impact..I think everything about it is perfect..you have successfully merged art with science 10</td>', 'wow..this has a huge impact..I think everything about it is perfect..you have successfully merged art with science 10', '2003-10-15 04:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
