(450909, 42212, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea flipping the pic over like that. I really love this kind of photography where you have to ask yourself "now how did he do that"? I''ll 10 ya for that one :-)</td>', 'Good idea flipping the pic over like that. I really love this kind of photography where you have to ask yourself "now how did he do that"? I''ll 10 ya for that one :-)', '2003-10-15 05:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
