(450957, 42124, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge, shame about these points:<br/>The lighting could be a lot better... at least 2 light sources are needed to avoid the ugly shadows.<br/>The base does not look very good... you need better material to compose your shot with other than this brown grainy stuff.<br/>The focus is badly out, you can really see this when looking at the text on the label.<br/> <br/>As I said though, fantastic concept which with better execution could have led to a winner, as DPCers like these kinds of shots.<br/>Score: 4</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge, shame about these points:The lighting could be a lot better... at least 2 light sources are needed to avoid the ugly shadows.The base does not look very good... you need better material to compose your shot with other than this brown grainy stuff.The focus is badly out, you can really see this when looking at the text on the label. As I said though, fantastic concept which with better execution could have led to a winner, as DPCers like these kinds of shots.Score: 4', '2003-10-15 07:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
