(450962, 42347, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great selection of books... I''m especially a big fan of the one at the bottom. However, I think that an imaginative response to the challenge involves more than just a stack of books. Many people use a pair of glasses next to books in a shot. Some use dramatic lighting. I would have thought about posing a couple of people... one measuring and one mediating in the background. Score: 3</td>', 'Great selection of books... I''m especially a big fan of the one at the bottom. However, I think that an imaginative response to the challenge involves more than just a stack of books. Many people use a pair of glasses next to books in a shot. Some use dramatic lighting. I would have thought about posing a couple of people... one measuring and one mediating in the background. Score: 3', '2003-10-15 07:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
