(450996, 41462, 11678, '<td valign="top">1 point off (9 instead of 10) for not putting a spot of light right at the tip of the ''dropper'' to throw the vision to a solid focal point, which it does lack..just a sparkle or a star (would be hard to do, I''m sure). Actually, that is the only fault... no strong dynamic focal point. Very good photo otherwise.</td>', '1 point off (9 instead of 10) for not putting a spot of light right at the tip of the ''dropper'' to throw the vision to a solid focal point, which it does lack..just a sparkle or a star (would be hard to do, I''m sure). Actually, that is the only fault... no strong dynamic focal point. Very good photo otherwise.', '2003-10-15 08:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(450998, 42346, 11114, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot - and thoroughly scientific to boot.  9</td>', 'Very cool shot - and thoroughly scientific to boot.  9', '2003-10-15 08:33:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(451000, 42141, 11678, '<td valign="top">This is one of those pics that - as it wrote to the screen, I said- "top 3" before I saw the entire image. I said it when the bug was half revealed. Usually that much color and saturation would bother me, but the grey gently pulls it off. Also the red background is soft rather than harsh which helps. Cute bug. Oh, well, it''s a 10 and I.m sure you know it !!</td>', 'This is one of those pics that - as it wrote to the screen, I said- "top 3" before I saw the entire image. I said it when the bug was half revealed. Usually that much color and saturation would bother me, but the grey gently pulls it off. Also the red background is soft rather than harsh which helps. Cute bug. Oh, well, it''s a 10 and I.m sure you know it !!', '2003-10-15 08:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(451003, 42152, 8522, '<td valign="top">Yes, I think this is an excellent way to meet the challenge. Seeing things under a magnifying glass is a great analogy for a lot of what science is about. And it looks great in this shot, lovely colours and composition. I think a lot of science is also about studying the inert and dead to understand the living, so autumn works very well for you here.<br/>Score: 10<br/>Edit: my favourite shot this challenge.</td>', 'Yes, I think this is an excellent way to meet the challenge. Seeing things under a magnifying glass is a great analogy for a lot of what science is about. And it looks great in this shot, lovely colours and composition. I think a lot of science is also about studying the inert and dead to understand the living, so autumn works very well for you here.Score: 10Edit: my favourite shot this challenge.', '2003-10-15 08:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(451007, 42239, 11155, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and a cool abstract!</td>', 'Wonderful colors and a cool abstract!', '2003-10-15 08:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
