(451010, 41831, 11155, '<td valign="top">Hmm, I don''t really think of balancing when I think of science - I know it''s related, but just not my first thought.  The orange and blues make a nice contrast.</td>', 'Hmm, I don''t really think of balancing when I think of science - I know it''s related, but just not my first thought.  The orange and blues make a nice contrast.', '2003-10-15 08:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(451012, 41463, 11155, '<td valign="top">Seems a bit of a stretch for a science topic, and I can hardly see the swan.  The reflections are awesome - maybe would have been better as a larger image than 400x300.</td>', 'Seems a bit of a stretch for a science topic, and I can hardly see the swan.  The reflections are awesome - maybe would have been better as a larger image than 400x300.', '2003-10-15 08:56:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(451014, 42349, 11155, '<td valign="top">Nice image.  Blues are great and the symbol really makes you think science.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice image.  Blues are great and the symbol really makes you think science.  Good luck!', '2003-10-15 08:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(451015, 42040, 11155, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if it''s my monitor or not, other images seem fine, but this one seems a tad dark.  I upped the brightness to see it better.  This is my favorite so far, I just wish it was a little more exposed.  It also looks a bit oversharpened (telescope is jagged).  Like I said, it''s my fave, so a ten from me if it were brighter.  So I''m giving it a 9.  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m not sure if it''s my monitor or not, other images seem fine, but this one seems a tad dark.  I upped the brightness to see it better.  This is my favorite so far, I just wish it was a little more exposed.  It also looks a bit oversharpened (telescope is jagged).  Like I said, it''s my fave, so a ten from me if it were brighter.  So I''m giving it a 9.  Good luck.', '2003-10-15 09:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(451017, 41809, 11155, '<td valign="top">Wonderful display of science.  Colors are nice and it''s a sharp image.  Good luck.</td>', 'Wonderful display of science.  Colors are nice and it''s a sharp image.  Good luck.', '2003-10-15 09:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(451018, 42339, 11678, '<td valign="top">Normally I don''t care for photos of a written page (in any competition) as I think it''s just a lack of imagination. But your title made the difference becasue it "made" the glasses and book the actual study being done. (Hope this makes sense). And, obviously, you nailed it technically. I gave it a 9 only because I think that with experimenting with focal length you could have gotten a bit more of the text in focus, up front there. I think the hard focus area needed to extend to the ''2 arctan'' line as that area is still very close to the eyes natural focal area when viewing a new image. Out-of-focus past the leading edge of the glasses is fine. I agonized over this one for a while (I rarely write comments). Very good photo, very pro. I could see this as part of an ad in Scientific American or something. I''m sure others won''t feel the same, but I like it.</td>', 'Normally I don''t care for photos of a written page (in any competition) as I think it''s just a lack of imagination. But your title made the difference becasue it "made" the glasses and book the actual study being done. (Hope this makes sense). And, obviously, you nailed it technically. I gave it a 9 only because I think that with experimenting with focal length you could have gotten a bit more of the text in focus, up front there. I think the hard focus area needed to extend to the ''2 arctan'' line as that area is still very close to the eyes natural focal area when viewing a new image. Out-of-focus past the leading edge of the glasses is fine. I agonized over this one for a while (I rarely write comments). Very good photo, very pro. I could see this as part of an ad in Scientific American or something. I''m sure others won''t feel the same, but I like it.', '2003-10-15 09:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(451019, 42109, 11486, '<td valign="top">Both dramatic and beutiful colors, as well as true sciense in the image! A 10!</td>', 'Both dramatic and beutiful colors, as well as true sciense in the image! A 10!', '2003-10-15 09:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
