(451062, 42227, 11486, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, and a beutiful result!</td>', 'Cool idea, and a beutiful result!', '2003-10-15 09:35:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(451064, 42344, 7187, '<td valign="top">This picture would look better with a different background, IMO.</td>', 'This picture would look better with a different background, IMO.', '2003-10-15 09:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(451065, 42130, 11678, '<td valign="top">Yup, it''s a 10</td>', 'Yup, it''s a 10', '2003-10-15 09:36:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(451066, 42309, 11678, '<td valign="top">Top 3 for sure</td>', 'Top 3 for sure', '2003-10-15 09:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(451068, 42097, 11486, '<td valign="top">Was thinking of using a harddrive, but coldnt find the broken one i have somwehre (and didnt want to open the one in my computer)<br/>But this was a better idea than mine!</td>', 'Was thinking of using a harddrive, but coldnt find the broken one i have somwehre (and didnt want to open the one in my computer)But this was a better idea than mine!', '2003-10-15 09:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(451069, 42223, 11155, '<td valign="top">This is a clever idea, but I wish the tazer thing was more in focus.</td>', 'This is a clever idea, but I wish the tazer thing was more in focus.', '2003-10-15 09:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(451070, 42090, 11486, '<td valign="top">I miss one camera, the one that you used for this photograph...</td>', 'I miss one camera, the one that you used for this photograph...', '2003-10-15 09:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(451074, 42322, 11486, '<td valign="top">A good idea, but not a very good photo. I dont know if it''s motion blur from camera shake or somthing else that makes the photo unfocused.</td>', 'A good idea, but not a very good photo. I dont know if it''s motion blur from camera shake or somthing else that makes the photo unfocused.', '2003-10-15 09:42:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(451077, 42057, 11486, '<td valign="top">Good idea, i to used a processor, but alone. And i like the reflecive surface under better than what i used also. Realy good, a 9.</td>', 'Good idea, i to used a processor, but alone. And i like the reflecive surface under better than what i used also. Realy good, a 9.', '2003-10-15 09:45:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(451078, 42260, 9424, '<td valign="top">???? More sharpness can be helpfull :-) Maybe its taken by old camera, like olympus 1400L</td>', '???? More sharpness can be helpfull :-) Maybe its taken by old camera, like olympus 1400L', '2003-10-15 09:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(451079, 42296, 9295, '<td valign="top">Kind of a cool abstract. Even though it doesn''t scream "Science" to me (haven''t the foggiest idea what Haematology is), I like the colors and lighting and I like the clarity of the droplet (is that what it is?) so that you can see the little air bubbles floating around in there.  You get points just for making me linger here trying to figure out what this is!  ;-)</td>', 'Kind of a cool abstract. Even though it doesn''t scream "Science" to me (haven''t the foggiest idea what Haematology is), I like the colors and lighting and I like the clarity of the droplet (is that what it is?) so that you can see the little air bubbles floating around in there.  You get points just for making me linger here trying to figure out what this is!  ;-)', '2003-10-15 09:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(451082, 42226, 11486, '<td valign="top">Not an easy text, but maybe this is THE SCIENCE, at least one of the most important of last century</td>', 'Not an easy text, but maybe this is THE SCIENCE, at least one of the most important of last century', '2003-10-15 09:47:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(451084, 42145, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful up-close capture of an autumn leave--very appropriate for this time of year.  I love the detail you captured, particularly the veins of the leaf and the colors fading into each other.</td>', 'This is a beautiful up-close capture of an autumn leave--very appropriate for this time of year.  I love the detail you captured, particularly the veins of the leaf and the colors fading into each other.', '2003-10-15 09:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(451086, 42299, 11486, '<td valign="top">A REALY imortant piece of science here. And a good  photo that captures the time of it''s creation. I can almost imagine that it is Charles himself reading the first copy...<br/></td>', 'A REALY imortant piece of science here. And a good  photo that captures the time of it''s creation. I can almost imagine that it is Charles himself reading the first copy...', '2003-10-15 09:50:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(451089, 42332, 11486, '<td valign="top">A good closeup, but a litle uneven light. The center part of the image is in shadow, and brigth light to the right. To me it would have been better with lighting in the center of the frame...</td>', 'A good closeup, but a litle uneven light. The center part of the image is in shadow, and brigth light to the right. To me it would have been better with lighting in the center of the frame...', '2003-10-15 09:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(451096, 41452, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a great anti-smoking campaign shot.  I like that you have the text slightly angled and the cigarette straight on. The lighting is good but I''m not sure about the focus being soft on the cigarette.  It''s not too bad and the clarity of the words seems good, but I''m wondering if it would be a little better if the cigarette itself were a little crisper.  No matter. I still like the concept a great deal. 8</td>', 'This is a great anti-smoking campaign shot.  I like that you have the text slightly angled and the cigarette straight on. The lighting is good but I''m not sure about the focus being soft on the cigarette.  It''s not too bad and the clarity of the words seems good, but I''m wondering if it would be a little better if the cigarette itself were a little crisper.  No matter. I still like the concept a great deal. 8', '2003-10-15 09:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(451099, 41452, 11486, '<td valign="top">Good idea, make me happy i never started to smoke :)</td>', 'Good idea, make me happy i never started to smoke :)', '2003-10-15 09:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(451103, 42124, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a fun little shot.  Just a couple of suggestions, take ''em or leave ''em:  The shadow under the Anacin bottle is a little too dark, if there''s a way to soften it a little I think that would work a little better (don''t get me wrong, I do think the shadow is important as it illustrates the fact that the bottle and pills are in the air, but it''s just a little overpowering IMHO); also, perhaps if you could find a more mood-altering type of medication (such as St. Johns Wort?) than aspirin, I think it would have more impact. Other than that, I like the playfulness of the shot and title.</td>', 'This is a fun little shot.  Just a couple of suggestions, take ''em or leave ''em:  The shadow under the Anacin bottle is a little too dark, if there''s a way to soften it a little I think that would work a little better (don''t get me wrong, I do think the shadow is important as it illustrates the fact that the bottle and pills are in the air, but it''s just a little overpowering IMHO); also, perhaps if you could find a more mood-altering type of medication (such as St. Johns Wort?) than aspirin, I think it would have more impact. Other than that, I like the playfulness of the shot and title.', '2003-10-15 10:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(451107, 42323, 11114, '<td valign="top">I like the quality of the light, and it''s somewhat scientific.  7</td>', 'I like the quality of the light, and it''s somewhat scientific.  7', '2003-10-15 10:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(451108, 42287, 9295, '<td valign="top">Your lighting and choice of background colors don''t really enhance this shot. I like your placement of the focal point and the concept but the overall appeal isn''t quite there.</td>', 'Your lighting and choice of background colors don''t really enhance this shot. I like your placement of the focal point and the concept but the overall appeal isn''t quite there.', '2003-10-15 10:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(451109, 42298, 11114, '<td valign="top">Definitely meets the challenge and not a bad photo - the relections on the glass are nice - could use some ooomph though</td>', 'Definitely meets the challenge and not a bad photo - the relections on the glass are nice - could use some ooomph though', '2003-10-15 10:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(451111, 42240, 11114, '<td valign="top">Wow - where is this?  The streak of green is awesome.   The electric lights are a bit distracting but I don''t know how''d I ''d solve that.  7</td>', 'Wow - where is this?  The streak of green is awesome.   The electric lights are a bit distracting but I don''t know how''d I ''d solve that.  7', '2003-10-15 10:09:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(451112, 42219, 11486, '<td valign="top">Realy somthing different from what i thougth. A good idea!</td>', 'Realy somthing different from what i thougth. A good idea!', '2003-10-15 10:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(451113, 42152, 9295, '<td valign="top">Using a magnifying glass to enhance the details of the leaf is a great way to bring out the theme of the challenge in this shot.  I like how the color of the leaf inside the glass is more green than the leaf to the right of the shot and how lighting them from behind gives them a sort of translucent quality.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'Using a magnifying glass to enhance the details of the leaf is a great way to bring out the theme of the challenge in this shot.  I like how the color of the leaf inside the glass is more green than the leaf to the right of the shot and how lighting them from behind gives them a sort of translucent quality.  Very nicely done.', '2003-10-15 10:09:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(451115, 42305, 11114, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous sky - not totally "scientific" but where does one draw the line between nature and science anyway?</td>', 'Gorgeous sky - not totally "scientific" but where does one draw the line between nature and science anyway?', '2003-10-15 10:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(451117, 42340, 11114, '<td valign="top">Very scientific - interesting visually, but needs a bit more impact I think.  6</td>', 'Very scientific - interesting visually, but needs a bit more impact I think.  6', '2003-10-15 10:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(451118, 42130, 9821, '<td valign="top">great</td>', 'great', '2003-10-15 10:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(451119, 41906, 11114, '<td valign="top">I considered these elements myself for this challenge - colours are a bit washed out looking to me, but definitely meets the challenge.  6</td>', 'I considered these elements myself for this challenge - colours are a bit washed out looking to me, but definitely meets the challenge.  6', '2003-10-15 10:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(451120, 42239, 9821, '<td valign="top">very cool</td>', 'very cool', '2003-10-15 10:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(451122, 42128, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot. The brightness of the light centered in the middle of the shot creates nice, clean lines of the worker''s hand and clothing and draws the eye up to the sign in the background as if this were an advertisement for Ford.</td>', 'I like this a lot. The brightness of the light centered in the middle of the shot creates nice, clean lines of the worker''s hand and clothing and draws the eye up to the sign in the background as if this were an advertisement for Ford.', '2003-10-15 10:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(451126, 41809, 10799, '<td valign="top">colors seem washed out...maybe a bit more saturation needed?</td>', 'colors seem washed out...maybe a bit more saturation needed?', '2003-10-15 10:15:29.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(451131, 42228, 11114, '<td valign="top">Scientific - nice colours - I''d like to be able to see the outline of the bulb a bet better. 7</td>', 'Scientific - nice colours - I''d like to be able to see the outline of the bulb a bet better. 7', '2003-10-15 10:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(451132, 41537, 11114, '<td valign="top">Scientific, but I wish I could actually see this goop better.</td>', 'Scientific, but I wish I could actually see this goop better.', '2003-10-15 10:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(451135, 41961, 11114, '<td valign="top">I like the title, it''s scientific and there''s some interesting colour in the sky - I think it''s just an optical illusion that makes part of the tower appear out of focus - 6</td>', 'I like the title, it''s scientific and there''s some interesting colour in the sky - I think it''s just an optical illusion that makes part of the tower appear out of focus - 6', '2003-10-15 10:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(451137, 42035, 9295, '<td valign="top">This has a very sweet, old-fashioned feel to it which is a great way to enhance your overall theme.  Using the sepia tones is perfect for this shot and your cropping is right on. I even like the border since this reminds me of pictures the way they used to be developed way back when I was a kid.  Nicely done.</td>', 'This has a very sweet, old-fashioned feel to it which is a great way to enhance your overall theme.  Using the sepia tones is perfect for this shot and your cropping is right on. I even like the border since this reminds me of pictures the way they used to be developed way back when I was a kid.  Nicely done.', '2003-10-15 10:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(451138, 41543, 11114, '<td valign="top">Nice macro - somewhat scientific - details could be a bit sharper. 6</td>', 'Nice macro - somewhat scientific - details could be a bit sharper. 6', '2003-10-15 10:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(451139, 42326, 11114, '<td valign="top">I want to enlarge this to see it better - it looks a bit indistinct as it is.</td>', 'I want to enlarge this to see it better - it looks a bit indistinct as it is.', '2003-10-15 10:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(451140, 42202, 9295, '<td valign="top">I don''t know that I would call this "science" (odds are more mathematical than scientific, yes?) but I like the shot a lot anyway.  I love that the 5th die hasn''t fallen yet leaving the question open-ended.  The lighting, cropping, the black&amp;white and DOF are all great.</td>', 'I don''t know that I would call this "science" (odds are more mathematical than scientific, yes?) but I like the shot a lot anyway.  I love that the 5th die hasn''t fallen yet leaving the question open-ended.  The lighting, cropping, the black&white and DOF are all great.', '2003-10-15 10:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(451141, 42265, 11114, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting - good composition - meets the challenge too - I like it.  8 at least, but I may go back and raise it after seeing all the entries</td>', 'Nice lighting - good composition - meets the challenge too - I like it.  8 at least, but I may go back and raise it after seeing all the entries', '2003-10-15 10:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(451146, 42130, 11114, '<td valign="top">Wow - totally a winner - perfectly scientific - tons of colour and impact - it has to be a 10</td>', 'Wow - totally a winner - perfectly scientific - tons of colour and impact - it has to be a 10', '2003-10-15 10:24:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(451147, 42344, 11114, '<td valign="top">Nice scientific experiment, but not a lot of visual appeal to my eye.</td>', 'Nice scientific experiment, but not a lot of visual appeal to my eye.', '2003-10-15 10:24:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(451148, 41792, 11114, '<td valign="top">Very cool - very scientific - one of the best - 9</td>', 'Very cool - very scientific - one of the best - 9', '2003-10-15 10:25:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(451150, 42322, 11114, '<td valign="top">The soft focus thing doesn''t work for me - i''d like it sharper, though I suspect you were going for a mood thing.</td>', 'The soft focus thing doesn''t work for me - i''d like it sharper, though I suspect you were going for a mood thing.', '2003-10-15 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(451154, 42173, 11114, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and lighting - certainly meets the challenge - I think it would be better without the hand, unless that is adding some meaning that I''m missing. 7</td>', 'Nice colours and lighting - certainly meets the challenge - I think it would be better without the hand, unless that is adding some meaning that I''m missing. 7', '2003-10-15 10:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(451157, 41647, 11114, '<td valign="top">Good subject - nice colours -  a worthy effort</td>', 'Good subject - nice colours -  a worthy effort', '2003-10-15 10:28:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(451162, 41539, 11114, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge and nice sharp focus on the rightmost crystal with the colours.  The rest is kinda out of focus though.  If that''s deliberate I think it should be a bit MORE out of focus so that the viewer knows for sure that it''s deliberate.  Nice black background and lighting in general.  7</td>', 'Meets the challenge and nice sharp focus on the rightmost crystal with the colours.  The rest is kinda out of focus though.  If that''s deliberate I think it should be a bit MORE out of focus so that the viewer knows for sure that it''s deliberate.  Nice black background and lighting in general.  7', '2003-10-15 10:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(451165, 42201, 12061, '<td valign="top">I don''t get a feel of "science" from it .. but I love the pic.</td>', 'I don''t get a feel of "science" from it .. but I love the pic.', '2003-10-15 10:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(451166, 42312, 12061, '<td valign="top">a little out of focus</td>', 'a little out of focus', '2003-10-15 10:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(451168, 41586, 11114, '<td valign="top">Wow - did you set all this up for the shot? I like the b &amp; w, although the slightly blue hose coils detract a bit for me.   I''d say it meets the challenge too.</td>', 'Wow - did you set all this up for the shot? I like the b & w, although the slightly blue hose coils detract a bit for me.   I''d say it meets the challenge too.', '2003-10-15 10:32:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(451170, 41811, 12061, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture. Great focus, composition and tones. They all work perfectly. 9</td>', 'Lovely picture. Great focus, composition and tones. They all work perfectly. 9', '2003-10-15 10:33:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(451173, 42172, 11114, '<td valign="top">A great idea - I played with refraction on cd''s too but couldn''t get this much colour - still the out-of-focus center of the cd distracts me.</td>', 'A great idea - I played with refraction on cd''s too but couldn''t get this much colour - still the out-of-focus center of the cd distracts me.', '2003-10-15 10:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(451180, 42095, 9295, '<td valign="top">I love the play on words, fun concept, but the photo itself is lacking in appeal.  The woman''s hair gets lost against the busy countertop and the lighting does little to draw interest to the display.</td>', 'I love the play on words, fun concept, but the photo itself is lacking in appeal.  The woman''s hair gets lost against the busy countertop and the lighting does little to draw interest to the display.', '2003-10-15 10:39:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(451181, 42227, 10785, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of the challenge! Superbly set up and very eye catching!</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of the challenge! Superbly set up and very eye catching!', '2003-10-15 10:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(451183, 42312, 10785, '<td valign="top">It''s a very good interpretaiton of the challenge. This needs to be more in focus though.</td>', 'It''s a very good interpretaiton of the challenge. This needs to be more in focus though.', '2003-10-15 10:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(451184, 42209, 12061, '<td valign="top">Too bad the horizon is tilted - otherwise I love the tones and soft lighting in this picture. 7</td>', 'Too bad the horizon is tilted - otherwise I love the tones and soft lighting in this picture. 7', '2003-10-15 10:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(451185, 41543, 12061, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t say science for me - A little grainy too. Great macro. 6</td>', 'This doesn''t say science for me - A little grainy too. Great macro. 6', '2003-10-15 10:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(451186, 42298, 12061, '<td valign="top">LOL quite the title you have there - the picture is a little too busy for my liking. I like the sharp focus and semi-fits the theme. 6</td>', 'LOL quite the title you have there - the picture is a little too busy for my liking. I like the sharp focus and semi-fits the theme. 6', '2003-10-15 10:51:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(451188, 42323, 12061, '<td valign="top">interesting - I think it would be a bit better if the light saturation was toned down a little, but overall its a nice clean looking photo that fits the theme. Great job! 8</td>', 'interesting - I think it would be a bit better if the light saturation was toned down a little, but overall its a nice clean looking photo that fits the theme. Great job! 8', '2003-10-15 10:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(451190, 42088, 10959, '<td valign="top">Very creative!</td>', 'Very creative!', '2003-10-15 10:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(451191, 41899, 10959, '<td valign="top">Good product shot--Nice lighting.</td>', 'Good product shot--Nice lighting.', '2003-10-15 10:55:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(451194, 42223, 11241, '<td valign="top">this image could be a little shaper....</td>', 'this image could be a little shaper....', '2003-10-15 11:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(451198, 41833, 11114, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous photo technically and meets the challenge.   I think I might have left less white space above and especially below, but what do I know?  I''ll say 8 for now and revisit that score after rating the rest.  Nicely done!</td>', 'This is a gorgeous photo technically and meets the challenge.   I think I might have left less white space above and especially below, but what do I know?  I''ll say 8 for now and revisit that score after rating the rest.  Nicely done!', '2003-10-15 11:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(451199, 42266, 11114, '<td valign="top">Very nice colours - I''d like to be in a bit closer and see more detail.</td>', 'Very nice colours - I''d like to be in a bit closer and see more detail.', '2003-10-15 11:08:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(451200, 41769, 11114, '<td valign="top">Technically a very good photo and certainly meets the challenge - The lighting is particularly professional.</td>', 'Technically a very good photo and certainly meets the challenge - The lighting is particularly professional.', '2003-10-15 11:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(451201, 42090, 11114, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and it''s well assembled and certainly meets the challenge.</td>', 'I like the idea and it''s well assembled and certainly meets the challenge.', '2003-10-15 11:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(451202, 42230, 12061, '<td valign="top">Way out of focus, lighting not the best.</td>', 'Way out of focus, lighting not the best.', '2003-10-15 11:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
