(451419, 42090, 10858, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea, also very good technics!</td>', 'Brilliant idea, also very good technics!', '2003-10-15 13:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(451427, 42202, 12922, '<td valign="top">I like the way this shot was set up, how you can just barely tell the last die is about to land as a 6.  It looks a little rigged to me, maybe have the first blurry die propped up a bit so it looks like it''s just about to stop moving.  Great picture though!</td>', 'I like the way this shot was set up, how you can just barely tell the last die is about to land as a 6.  It looks a little rigged to me, maybe have the first blurry die propped up a bit so it looks like it''s just about to stop moving.  Great picture though!', '2003-10-15 14:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(451428, 42331, 12922, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, looks like something you''d see through the hubble telescope!</td>', 'Beautiful shot, looks like something you''d see through the hubble telescope!', '2003-10-15 14:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(451429, 42130, 8860, '<td valign="top">Smart, smooth shot. Perhaps a little too much inactive space top right, and lacking a scientific experiment, but very attractive nonetheless (these plasma balls are always mesmerising).</td>', 'Smart, smooth shot. Perhaps a little too much inactive space top right, and lacking a scientific experiment, but very attractive nonetheless (these plasma balls are always mesmerising).', '2003-10-15 14:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(451432, 42297, 8860, '<td valign="top">I really like the textures in this - a novel approach. The even lighting looks almost like a 3D rendering. The small element to the left of the composition is distracting and I''d like to see more of the bottom parts. Outside of the challenge though, this shot would be fairly bland to most.</td>', 'I really like the textures in this - a novel approach. The even lighting looks almost like a 3D rendering. The small element to the left of the composition is distracting and I''d like to see more of the bottom parts. Outside of the challenge though, this shot would be fairly bland to most.', '2003-10-15 14:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(451437, 41979, 8860, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... bit of a shoehorn job to get this into science! It''s really more natural than scientific anyway. As it turns out, the image is really not good enough. The focus is soft, colours are muted, it''s too central and leaves little to the imagination. Sorry I can''t be more positive.</td>', 'Hmmm... bit of a shoehorn job to get this into science! It''s really more natural than scientific anyway. As it turns out, the image is really not good enough. The focus is soft, colours are muted, it''s too central and leaves little to the imagination. Sorry I can''t be more positive.', '2003-10-15 14:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(451438, 42326, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and texture. Wrong challenge!</td>', 'Nice colours and texture. Wrong challenge!', '2003-10-15 14:21:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(451439, 42227, 8860, '<td valign="top">Top marks for some very nice designer script! You''re in graphics right? Surely no other genre of work can yield such pedantic behaviour.  ; )<br/> <br/>I love this for its cheeky design, punchy colour and sheer unusualness in the challenge. It stretches the theme a bit thin but, frankly, I don''t care right now! [9]</td>', 'Top marks for some very nice designer script! You''re in graphics right? Surely no other genre of work can yield such pedantic behaviour.  ; ) I love this for its cheeky design, punchy colour and sheer unusualness in the challenge. It stretches the theme a bit thin but, frankly, I don''t care right now! [9]', '2003-10-15 14:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(451440, 42001, 12922, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  I like the way you set up the "stem"</td>', 'Very cool!  I like the way you set up the "stem"', '2003-10-15 14:26:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(451443, 41520, 12922, '<td valign="top">The texture almost makes it look like an oil painting, very cool.</td>', 'The texture almost makes it look like an oil painting, very cool.', '2003-10-15 14:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
