(451446, 41831, 8860, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to say! I just wasn''t expecting this. What''s it in Science for - I must be missing something? Aside of the challenge it''s an interesting shot.</td>', 'I don''t know what to say! I just wasn''t expecting this. What''s it in Science for - I must be missing something? Aside of the challenge it''s an interesting shot.', '2003-10-15 14:32:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(451448, 42330, 5792, '<td valign="top">With GPS we are not in Kansas anymore.</td>', 'With GPS we are not in Kansas anymore.', '2003-10-15 14:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(451450, 42007, 12922, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit too posed to me (mostly the lipstick), and in my eyes is kind of a stretch for Science.  The background is a little distracting, it almost makes me want to squint to get the pond and waterfall (?) in focus.</td>', 'This looks a bit too posed to me (mostly the lipstick), and in my eyes is kind of a stretch for Science.  The background is a little distracting, it almost makes me want to squint to get the pond and waterfall (?) in focus.', '2003-10-15 14:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(451453, 42124, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great idea. Focus is not crisp enough for a high scorer but I reckon it''s worth re-shooting until you get it perfect. Were you using a tripod, fast shutter speed, etc.?</td>', 'Great idea. Focus is not crisp enough for a high scorer but I reckon it''s worth re-shooting until you get it perfect. Were you using a tripod, fast shutter speed, etc.?', '2003-10-15 14:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(451454, 41756, 8860, '<td valign="top">Science? Just too indistinct this one - even for my abstract-orientated brain! You could get close to the bottom with this one at least, which is small consolation!  ; )</td>', 'Science? Just too indistinct this one - even for my abstract-orientated brain! You could get close to the bottom with this one at least, which is small consolation!  ; )', '2003-10-15 14:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
