(451522, 42322, 12268, '<td valign="top">nice idea but out of focus. I recently tried to take similar shots &amp; discovered that exposure in shooting the moon is really important in getting a clear shot of it. Also, remembering that the moon is being illuminated by the sun helps to keep in mind the importance of adjusting exposure. I still have yet to get it right myself.</td>', 'nice idea but out of focus. I recently tried to take similar shots & discovered that exposure in shooting the moon is really important in getting a clear shot of it. Also, remembering that the moon is being illuminated by the sun helps to keep in mind the importance of adjusting exposure. I still have yet to get it right myself.', '2003-10-15 16:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
