(451633, 42088, 1176, '<td valign="top">amazing</td>', 'amazing', '2003-10-15 20:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(451637, 42219, 12578, '<td valign="top">Having worked at an airport i find it difficult to imagine this ammount of the same plane so clase together ?</td>', 'Having worked at an airport i find it difficult to imagine this ammount of the same plane so clase together ?', '2003-10-15 20:44:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(451640, 42197, 7778, '<td valign="top">Dramatic, yet fine light, very satisfying tonal gradation, a remarkable photograph. The generous expanse of sky remains perfectly balanced (1/3 : 2/3, spatially and with respect to distribution of colour weight). Even the beams of light appear within thirds. I also applaud the avoidance of any optical artifacts for this natural capture. <br/> <br/>The near central position of the tower (and directly under the light source) however, to my senses, fails the compositional givens of this otherwise outstanding capture.</td>', 'Dramatic, yet fine light, very satisfying tonal gradation, a remarkable photograph. The generous expanse of sky remains perfectly balanced (1/3 : 2/3, spatially and with respect to distribution of colour weight). Even the beams of light appear within thirds. I also applaud the avoidance of any optical artifacts for this natural capture.  The near central position of the tower (and directly under the light source) however, to my senses, fails the compositional givens of this otherwise outstanding capture.', '2003-10-15 20:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(451641, 41750, 12330, '<td valign="top">cool texture, looks old.</td>', 'cool texture, looks old.', '2003-10-15 20:47:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(451650, 42309, 1647, '<td valign="top">Great colour, great detail.  The only thing I''m not totally sure about is the blue blur in the top right - it seems a little bit out of place.</td>', 'Great colour, great detail.  The only thing I''m not totally sure about is the blue blur in the top right - it seems a little bit out of place.', '2003-10-15 20:58:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(451651, 41463, 7778, '<td valign="top">I regret both the small size and the inclusion of the partial plants in the very foreground in this otherwise incredibly romantic image. I really don''t know what it is doing in this particular challenge, although I am grateful for this unexpected change of pace. If it is chosen with ironic intend, the irony would be lovely. ;-)<br/> <br/>This imperfect and memorable image has considerable beauty. &gt; 7</td>', 'I regret both the small size and the inclusion of the partial plants in the very foreground in this otherwise incredibly romantic image. I really don''t know what it is doing in this particular challenge, although I am grateful for this unexpected change of pace. If it is chosen with ironic intend, the irony would be lovely. ;-) This imperfect and memorable image has considerable beauty. > 7', '2003-10-15 20:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(451657, 41460, 11508, '<td valign="top">I really the way the backround is almost the same tone as the bird, but not quite. I think it could be more powerful if the light was coming from the other dirrections, or the birds head turned towards the light, so that there were more details on the birds eye. I bet it is extremely hard to get birds to pose for pictures however. Overall I like this alot, 7.</td>', 'I really the way the backround is almost the same tone as the bird, but not quite. I think it could be more powerful if the light was coming from the other dirrections, or the birds head turned towards the light, so that there were more details on the birds eye. I bet it is extremely hard to get birds to pose for pictures however. Overall I like this alot, 7.', '2003-10-15 21:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
