(451685, 41459, 3664, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the photograph, the cropping and the tone of image. I think it captures the idea of the challenge embodies. The only thing I find somewhat distracting is the glare  coming off of the glass, but I don''t know if that could have been avoided and you still have gotten that angle, even despite that good job good job</td>', 'I like the composition of the photograph, the cropping and the tone of image. I think it captures the idea of the challenge embodies. The only thing I find somewhat distracting is the glare  coming off of the glass, but I don''t know if that could have been avoided and you still have gotten that angle, even despite that good job good job', '2003-10-15 21:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
