(451697, 42293, 3664, '<td valign="top">I like the photograph but not the title. Sometimes it''s better to just have untitled because giving an image a title that  isn''t  quite necessary can lead a viewer to interpret an image the wrong way or in some situations make it to easy for them, in a sense letting them off the hook and not forcing them to decipher what is happening within the image. Anyway, nice image.</td>', 'I like the photograph but not the title. Sometimes it''s better to just have untitled because giving an image a title that  isn''t  quite necessary can lead a viewer to interpret an image the wrong way or in some situations make it to easy for them, in a sense letting them off the hook and not forcing them to decipher what is happening within the image. Anyway, nice image.', '2003-10-15 21:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
