(451870, 42307, 9437, '<td valign="top">Like the metallic look that some of the drops have.</td>', 'Like the metallic look that some of the drops have.', '2003-10-15 23:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(451872, 42354, 9437, '<td valign="top">Like the flare on the kettle and the steam in the air.</td>', 'Like the flare on the kettle and the steam in the air.', '2003-10-15 23:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(451875, 42263, 11738, '<td valign="top">Cool idea, but I find your choice of focus point not quite right.  I would have focused on the teeth instead of the nasal cavity.  I imagine you were trying to bring out the bone structure of the nasal cavity.<br/> <br/>A shot closer to the skull showing teeth, nasal cavity and part of occipital bones only would have been interesting as well.<br/> <br/>What kind of animal is this?  From my limited knowledge of mammalian dentition structure, I would guess that this might be some sort of sea mammal.  Seal maybe?</td>', 'Cool idea, but I find your choice of focus point not quite right.  I would have focused on the teeth instead of the nasal cavity.  I imagine you were trying to bring out the bone structure of the nasal cavity. A shot closer to the skull showing teeth, nasal cavity and part of occipital bones only would have been interesting as well. What kind of animal is this?  From my limited knowledge of mammalian dentition structure, I would guess that this might be some sort of sea mammal.  Seal maybe?', '2003-10-15 23:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(451877, 41711, 9437, '<td valign="top">nice color scheme.</td>', 'nice color scheme.', '2003-10-15 23:33:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(451879, 42212, 9437, '<td valign="top">Good action picture. Love the exhaust.</td>', 'Good action picture. Love the exhaust.', '2003-10-15 23:37:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(451883, 42315, 9437, '<td valign="top">Just in time for Halloween. It''s got all 5 zones, I''ll say that for it.</td>', 'Just in time for Halloween. It''s got all 5 zones, I''ll say that for it.', '2003-10-15 23:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(451884, 42187, 10768, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors, nice composition and I really like the moisture beads.  Very nice.</td>', 'Lovely colors, nice composition and I really like the moisture beads.  Very nice.', '2003-10-15 23:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(451885, 42159, 11738, '<td valign="top">Neat colours but way too busy.  I would have focussed more attention on one part of this image, giving it more detail and enhancing the quality of the image.</td>', 'Neat colours but way too busy.  I would have focussed more attention on one part of this image, giving it more detail and enhancing the quality of the image.', '2003-10-15 23:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(451886, 41811, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good contrast in the shot.  Very interesting composition.  This photo would make for a great science school book cover. "10"</td>', 'Good contrast in the shot.  Very interesting composition.  This photo would make for a great science school book cover. "10"', '2003-10-15 23:42:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(451887, 42186, 10768, '<td valign="top">Like the bright colors on the parachute.  Nice composition and I like the expression on the boys face and the uplifted arms which show excitement.  Very good shot.</td>', 'Like the bright colors on the parachute.  Nice composition and I like the expression on the boys face and the uplifted arms which show excitement.  Very good shot.', '2003-10-15 23:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(451888, 42227, 9437, '<td valign="top">Super photo. It''s simple, well lit and monotone. It must have taken a long time to place those drops correctly. 10</td>', 'Super photo. It''s simple, well lit and monotone. It must have taken a long time to place those drops correctly. 10', '2003-10-15 23:42:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(451889, 42096, 11738, '<td valign="top">Nice picture but too much of an easy out for the topic.</td>', 'Nice picture but too much of an easy out for the topic.', '2003-10-15 23:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(451890, 42007, 9437, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast in paradigms: artificial beauty (by science) against natural beauty. Good job. 8</td>', 'I like the contrast in paradigms: artificial beauty (by science) against natural beauty. Good job. 8', '2003-10-15 23:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(451891, 42331, 9437, '<td valign="top">Though I know it''s light, it looks like graphic art. Well done.</td>', 'Though I know it''s light, it looks like graphic art. Well done.', '2003-10-15 23:46:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(451893, 42058, 11738, '<td valign="top">Very nice image but small and blocky.  Hand holding pencil is blurry and most of image is not focussed.  Not sure what pencil is doing in the image since there is no place to write and nothing on which to write, or is the microscope resting on a glass-top table?</td>', 'Very nice image but small and blocky.  Hand holding pencil is blurry and most of image is not focussed.  Not sure what pencil is doing in the image since there is no place to write and nothing on which to write, or is the microscope resting on a glass-top table?', '2003-10-15 23:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(451895, 42222, 11738, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  This could have scored higher if it wasn''t soooo overexposed.  The wide white frame seems to make things even worse.  A plain B&amp;W picture would have been better.</td>', 'Good idea.  This could have scored higher if it wasn''t soooo overexposed.  The wide white frame seems to make things even worse.  A plain B&W picture would have been better.', '2003-10-15 23:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(451899, 42141, 675, '<td valign="top">biology is a science...8</td>', 'biology is a science...8', '2003-10-15 23:56:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(451900, 42260, 11895, '<td valign="top">moebius strip, great idea for this challenge</td>', 'moebius strip, great idea for this challenge', '2003-10-15 23:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(451904, 42180, 11895, '<td valign="top">very nice picture that fits the theme well, a bit too much light on this little guy\''s nose</td>', 'very nice picture that fits the theme well, a bit too much light on this little guy\''s nose', '2003-10-16 00:08:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(451905, 42345, 13206, '<td valign="top">The purple color could be a little bolder, the background could have been a little smother. Great concept.</td>', 'The purple color could be a little bolder, the background could have been a little smother. Great concept.', '2003-10-16 00:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(451911, 42103, 9441, '<td valign="top">Beautiful fall colors.  I wish it were just a little sharper and clearer.  Good composition.</td>', 'Beautiful fall colors.  I wish it were just a little sharper and clearer.  Good composition.', '2003-10-16 00:11:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(451914, 41599, 9441, '<td valign="top">Very interesting photo.  Wonderful colors, nice cropping...good job!  10.</td>', 'Very interesting photo.  Wonderful colors, nice cropping...good job!  10.', '2003-10-16 00:15:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(451916, 42140, 9441, '<td valign="top">Awesome vibrant colors, interesting concept here...I like the cropping....well done...10.</td>', 'Awesome vibrant colors, interesting concept here...I like the cropping....well done...10.', '2003-10-16 00:18:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(451917, 42320, 9437, '<td valign="top">Almost makes me feel like I''m there. 10</td>', 'Almost makes me feel like I''m there. 10', '2003-10-16 00:20:32.000000', NULL, 1);
