(451933, 42239, 9437, '<td valign="top">Like the play of the violet against the yellow. Also like the near abstract look of the photo. Good job.</td>', 'Like the play of the violet against the yellow. Also like the near abstract look of the photo. Good job.', '2003-10-16 00:38:02.000000', NULL, 1),
