(451951, 42095, 4338, '<td valign="top">i feel a little lower camera angle and take the hair out of the photo and some different lighting would have made this a stronger image.</td>', 'i feel a little lower camera angle and take the hair out of the photo and some different lighting would have made this a stronger image.', '2003-10-16 01:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
