(452069, 42273, 12361, '<td valign="top">great one.  one of the oldest living creatures on the planet.  i think they will end up preserving us.</td>', 'great one.  one of the oldest living creatures on the planet.  i think they will end up preserving us.', '2003-10-16 02:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(452071, 42228, 12361, '<td valign="top">oohhh good one.  i''ve done a similar ppic in black and white.  light bulbs can be some of the most facinating subjects, just turn them on!</td>', 'oohhh good one.  i''ve done a similar ppic in black and white.  light bulbs can be some of the most facinating subjects, just turn them on!', '2003-10-16 02:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(452073, 41537, 12361, '<td valign="top">looks like intestines.  cool experiment.</td>', 'looks like intestines.  cool experiment.', '2003-10-16 03:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(452075, 42285, 12361, '<td valign="top">just think of where we would be if this hadn''t happened.  a really good quality photo, great effort. keep em rolling...</td>', 'just think of where we would be if this hadn''t happened.  a really good quality photo, great effort. keep em rolling...', '2003-10-16 03:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(452096, 41462, 11184, '<td valign="top">Overall really works well..  Love the reddish coloring on the dropper against the bluish background.   Although the background arguably has some distracting areas to it, the DOF iis perfect.  My big dissapointment, however, are the smudges and spots in the testube.  I think it really distracts from the main droplet focal point and unfortunately loses alot of the clinical feel and hence the impact.</td>', 'Overall really works well..  Love the reddish coloring on the dropper against the bluish background.   Although the background arguably has some distracting areas to it, the DOF iis perfect.  My big dissapointment, however, are the smudges and spots in the testube.  I think it really distracts from the main droplet focal point and unfortunately loses alot of the clinical feel and hence the impact.', '2003-10-16 03:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(452101, 42212, 11321, '<td valign="top">:D:D:D<br/>couple of a big extra points for creativity</td>', ':D:D:Dcouple of a big extra points for creativity', '2003-10-16 03:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(452149, 42306, 10739, '<td valign="top">The main subject is a bit dark. May be the pills falling from the jar would be more dramatic</td>', 'The main subject is a bit dark. May be the pills falling from the jar would be more dramatic', '2003-10-16 06:24:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(452150, 42259, 10739, '<td valign="top">Better lighting</td>', 'Better lighting', '2003-10-16 06:25:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(452152, 42209, 10739, '<td valign="top">I think horizontally would work better. The picture is tilted (very distracting)</td>', 'I think horizontally would work better. The picture is tilted (very distracting)', '2003-10-16 06:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(452153, 42001, 10739, '<td valign="top">The colors are a bit dull. Improve the sharpness</td>', 'The colors are a bit dull. Improve the sharpness', '2003-10-16 06:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
