(452163, 42227, 10739, '<td valign="top">Nice idea :), how you manage with the size of the drops ??? A bit dark the picture, to say something</td>', 'Nice idea :), how you manage with the size of the drops ??? A bit dark the picture, to say something', '2003-10-16 06:42:17.000000', NULL, 1),
