(452360, 42225, 12061, '<td valign="top">Great composition and colors. 8</td>', 'Great composition and colors. 8', '2003-10-16 10:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(452364, 42224, 8624, '<td valign="top">perfectly captures the spirit of the challenge and is well composed and interesting. The Hazmat suit and test tubes make it very apparent that you are observing a scientist at work. His eyes lead you right to the point at which he is concentrating - where the test tubes meet. I like the positioning within the frame. Lighting and exposure and top notch. my favorite of the group. 9</td>', 'perfectly captures the spirit of the challenge and is well composed and interesting. The Hazmat suit and test tubes make it very apparent that you are observing a scientist at work. His eyes lead you right to the point at which he is concentrating - where the test tubes meet. I like the positioning within the frame. Lighting and exposure and top notch. my favorite of the group. 9', '2003-10-16 10:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(452441, 42131, 11111, '<td valign="top">Was this difficult for you? You did it well! I tried and failed so I didn''t submit mine. Nice job. I think more dof would refine this as well as a bit stronger light so you can make out more detail on the needle''s eye.</td>', 'Was this difficult for you? You did it well! I tried and failed so I didn''t submit mine. Nice job. I think more dof would refine this as well as a bit stronger light so you can make out more detail on the needle''s eye.', '2003-10-16 11:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(452443, 42145, 11111, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. Nice job.</td>', 'Beautiful. Nice job.', '2003-10-16 11:28:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(452448, 42354, 11111, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous teapot you have here. Good capture of that steam, too. Great choice of b&amp;w. This is one of my top pics.</td>', 'Gorgeous teapot you have here. Good capture of that steam, too. Great choice of b&w. This is one of my top pics.', '2003-10-16 11:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(452453, 41539, 11111, '<td valign="top">Good job. I know this was probably tough. Since the shard at left is larger it seems to me to dominate the space, but it''s not in focus. I think a shift in focus to that shard, rather than the smaller one would''ve made composition stronger. Good exposure and subject.</td>', 'Good job. I know this was probably tough. Since the shard at left is larger it seems to me to dominate the space, but it''s not in focus. I think a shift in focus to that shard, rather than the smaller one would''ve made composition stronger. Good exposure and subject.', '2003-10-16 11:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(452460, 41906, 11111, '<td valign="top">The pink sheet doesn''t add any interest to this, it detracts from it. Good job capturing motion. Needs better focus as well.</td>', 'The pink sheet doesn''t add any interest to this, it detracts from it. Good job capturing motion. Needs better focus as well.', '2003-10-16 11:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(452466, 42197, 11111, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo. Particularly enjoyed contrast between manmade and natural light producers. Smart. Sharp focus. Good one! Might be more interesting with a more off center subject (power line thing).</td>', 'Beautiful photo. Particularly enjoyed contrast between manmade and natural light producers. Smart. Sharp focus. Good one! Might be more interesting with a more off center subject (power line thing).', '2003-10-16 11:35:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(452469, 41586, 11111, '<td valign="top">How lucky for you to be at a play - i assume! great photo. Wonderful composition, interesting subject, and good b&amp;w exposure.</td>', 'How lucky for you to be at a play - i assume! great photo. Wonderful composition, interesting subject, and good b&w exposure.', '2003-10-16 11:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(452474, 42184, 11111, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but I don''t know why you wouldn''t include the telescope as your subject as well? the composition hints that this the telescope should be the main subject but the title says other. Kinda confusing, but good idea. Needs greater DOF and shift of map to convey your thoughts. Just assuming what you were trying to do.</td>', 'Interesting idea, but I don''t know why you wouldn''t include the telescope as your subject as well? the composition hints that this the telescope should be the main subject but the title says other. Kinda confusing, but good idea. Needs greater DOF and shift of map to convey your thoughts. Just assuming what you were trying to do.', '2003-10-16 11:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(452481, 42034, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the composition. The colors realy pop out at you.</td>', 'I like the composition. The colors realy pop out at you.', '2003-10-16 11:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(452482, 42270, 6845, '<td valign="top">Poor apple. I like your idea. The background, however, I find very distracting. Maybe if you could have put a solid color or white sheet,  piece of paper, etc.,  between the person and the apple.</td>', 'Poor apple. I like your idea. The background, however, I find very distracting. Maybe if you could have put a solid color or white sheet,  piece of paper, etc.,  between the person and the apple.', '2003-10-16 11:47:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(452485, 42343, 6845, '<td valign="top">I can''t quite tell, but the inage seems out of focus. If you have or had the right equipment at your disposal, I would have liked to have seen just three or four of the crystals filling the frame. I like your idea though, it is alot more original than most in this challenge, mine included.</td>', 'I can''t quite tell, but the inage seems out of focus. If you have or had the right equipment at your disposal, I would have liked to have seen just three or four of the crystals filling the frame. I like your idea though, it is alot more original than most in this challenge, mine included.', '2003-10-16 11:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(452490, 42330, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Personally I would have liked to seen the composition made a lot tighter. Maybe pick just one interesting piece of the map and then place the compass and the gps tracker closer together. Then crop in tight trying to make a more dramatic composition.</td>', 'Nice idea. Personally I would have liked to seen the composition made a lot tighter. Maybe pick just one interesting piece of the map and then place the compass and the gps tracker closer together. Then crop in tight trying to make a more dramatic composition.', '2003-10-16 11:52:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(452492, 42093, 6845, '<td valign="top">I feel that a stronger angle and a different composition could have made this a really interesting image. It looks a bit flat and doesn''t pop out at me. I do like the soft warm light that fills the image.</td>', 'I feel that a stronger angle and a different composition could have made this a really interesting image. It looks a bit flat and doesn''t pop out at me. I do like the soft warm light that fills the image.', '2003-10-16 11:55:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(452494, 42221, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting image. Nice and simple and a neet composition. For me, however, I would have liked to have seen a little more seperation between the subject and the background. They almost blend together and take a little away from the graphic design that the composition creates.</td>', 'This is a very interesting image. Nice and simple and a neet composition. For me, however, I would have liked to have seen a little more seperation between the subject and the background. They almost blend together and take a little away from the graphic design that the composition creates.', '2003-10-16 11:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(452495, 42313, 6845, '<td valign="top">Personally I would have liked to see the hands and the brain in focus and the face slightly out of focus, I like the overall coposition and the lighting used.</td>', 'Personally I would have liked to see the hands and the brain in focus and the face slightly out of focus, I like the overall coposition and the lighting used.', '2003-10-16 11:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(452496, 42064, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like this. It is a nice composition. I like the little spots of color throughout the image.</td>', 'I like this. It is a nice composition. I like the little spots of color throughout the image.', '2003-10-16 11:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(452497, 42354, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good soft light on the subject. I also like the composition.</td>', 'Good soft light on the subject. I also like the composition.', '2003-10-16 12:00:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(452498, 42096, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good fall image. Nice bright colors.</td>', 'Good fall image. Nice bright colors.', '2003-10-16 12:01:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(452500, 42173, 6845, '<td valign="top">For me personally, the finger is distracting. I don''t understand why it is in the image. I do like the lighting technique you tried.</td>', 'For me personally, the finger is distracting. I don''t understand why it is in the image. I do like the lighting technique you tried.', '2003-10-16 12:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(452505, 41979, 6845, '<td valign="top">I would have liked this better if the bee wasn''t so dark. It is a nice bug shot.</td>', 'I would have liked this better if the bee wasn''t so dark. It is a nice bug shot.', '2003-10-16 12:11:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(452506, 41586, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a nice image. I like the expressions on their faces. It is a nice composition.</td>', 'This is a nice image. I like the expressions on their faces. It is a nice composition.', '2003-10-16 12:12:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(452509, 42213, 6845, '<td valign="top">For me, there are too many distracting highlights on the jars. I like the composition and the use of reflection though.</td>', 'For me, there are too many distracting highlights on the jars. I like the composition and the use of reflection though.', '2003-10-16 12:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(452512, 42259, 12526, '<td valign="top">Very unique shot, sharp and contrasted. Maybe shot more wide open to give more depth of field and this would be perfect.</td>', 'Very unique shot, sharp and contrasted. Maybe shot more wide open to give more depth of field and this would be perfect.', '2003-10-16 12:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(452513, 42320, 12526, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image and title.</td>', 'Beautiful image and title.', '2003-10-16 12:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(452514, 42308, 6845, '<td valign="top">If possible I would have tried to move the objects further from the wall to help elliminate shadows. Then tried to move the objects in closer to each other to make for a tighter composition and tried not to put the items in a straight line with each other. This would have created more depth to the image. I like the idea and the subject matter however.</td>', 'If possible I would have tried to move the objects further from the wall to help elliminate shadows. Then tried to move the objects in closer to each other to make for a tighter composition and tried not to put the items in a straight line with each other. This would have created more depth to the image. I like the idea and the subject matter however.', '2003-10-16 12:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(452515, 41520, 12526, '<td valign="top">Very vivid color. I enjoy this image.</td>', 'Very vivid color. I enjoy this image.', '2003-10-16 12:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(452518, 42159, 12526, '<td valign="top">Great image, holds your attention and entertains the mind.</td>', 'Great image, holds your attention and entertains the mind.', '2003-10-16 12:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(452519, 42193, 6845, '<td valign="top">For my tastes, I would have liked to seen more of the black on the right side cropped off. I feel that then the image might be a little more dramatic. I like the simplicity of the image however.</td>', 'For my tastes, I would have liked to seen more of the black on the right side cropped off. I feel that then the image might be a little more dramatic. I like the simplicity of the image however.', '2003-10-16 12:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(452520, 42331, 12526, '<td valign="top">very captivating</td>', 'very captivating', '2003-10-16 12:19:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(452524, 42227, 11241, '<td valign="top">This is great...love the color really goes with the shot.....10</td>', 'This is great...love the color really goes with the shot.....10', '2003-10-16 12:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(452525, 41505, 12526, '<td valign="top">great subject, but image seems to be pixelated. Maybe shoot in RAW?</td>', 'great subject, but image seems to be pixelated. Maybe shoot in RAW?', '2003-10-16 12:20:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(452526, 41759, 12526, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2003-10-16 12:20:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(452527, 42057, 6845, '<td valign="top">Are people sharing props, or just have the same ideas. I like the subjects you have chosen, and the light is nice and dramatic. I think I would have liked to have seen more cropped from the bottom however.</td>', 'Are people sharing props, or just have the same ideas. I like the subjects you have chosen, and the light is nice and dramatic. I think I would have liked to have seen more cropped from the bottom however.', '2003-10-16 12:20:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(452528, 42227, 12526, '<td valign="top">very unique idea and great capture of the subject.</td>', 'very unique idea and great capture of the subject.', '2003-10-16 12:21:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(452530, 42296, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a nice strong graphic image. I find it very appealing. This is on of my favorites for the challenge.</td>', 'This is a nice strong graphic image. I find it very appealing. This is on of my favorites for the challenge.', '2003-10-16 12:22:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(452531, 41462, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Great depth of field. This is one of my top picks for the week.</td>', 'Nice shot. Great depth of field. This is one of my top picks for the week.', '2003-10-16 12:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(452532, 42273, 12526, '<td valign="top">Good subject, I enjoy photographing herps. Maybe shoot in RAW next time if you didn''t already</td>', 'Good subject, I enjoy photographing herps. Maybe shoot in RAW next time if you didn''t already', '2003-10-16 12:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(452533, 42141, 12526, '<td valign="top">absolutely vivid capture. I very much enjoy this image and wouldn''t change a thing. Good work</td>', 'absolutely vivid capture. I very much enjoy this image and wouldn''t change a thing. Good work', '2003-10-16 12:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(452534, 42187, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice macro shot. The water beeds add so much to the subject. I personally would have liked to have seen a little more of the right side cropped out. But that is just my feelings.</td>', 'Nice macro shot. The water beeds add so much to the subject. I personally would have liked to have seen a little more of the right side cropped out. But that is just my feelings.', '2003-10-16 12:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(452535, 41759, 12151, '<td valign="top">I really like how you got close enough to almost see the individual powdery scales on the wings.  I just can''t tell if the wings are blurred, or if it naturally looks that way...</td>', 'I really like how you got close enough to almost see the individual powdery scales on the wings.  I just can''t tell if the wings are blurred, or if it naturally looks that way...', '2003-10-16 12:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(452537, 42346, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice graphic image. For my taste, it is a little to dark. But I really enjoy the shapes being made out of the lines.</td>', 'Nice graphic image. For my taste, it is a little to dark. But I really enjoy the shapes being made out of the lines.', '2003-10-16 12:25:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(452539, 41917, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice waterfall image. It is a nice composition and it looks good in black and white.</td>', 'Nice waterfall image. It is a nice composition and it looks good in black and white.', '2003-10-16 12:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(452542, 42202, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and how the dice in the back is still in the air. I like the dof. nice image.</td>', 'I like the composition and how the dice in the back is still in the air. I like the dof. nice image.', '2003-10-16 12:27:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(452543, 42326, 6845, '<td valign="top">For me, if the ring in the middle was more off center, I think that would have helped make the image more appealing. I like the simplicity of the image though.</td>', 'For me, if the ring in the middle was more off center, I think that would have helped make the image more appealing. I like the simplicity of the image though.', '2003-10-16 12:29:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(452545, 42259, 12061, '<td valign="top">Excellent action shot!! 8</td>', 'Excellent action shot!! 8', '2003-10-16 12:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(452546, 42201, 6845, '<td valign="top">This makes for a nice graphic image. I like the tight crop.</td>', 'This makes for a nice graphic image. I like the tight crop.', '2003-10-16 12:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(452549, 42332, 6845, '<td valign="top">The focus seems soft. I like your choice of angle and the tight crop you went with.</td>', 'The focus seems soft. I like your choice of angle and the tight crop you went with.', '2003-10-16 12:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(452550, 41811, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice image. The sepia works great with both subjects. Nice light and composition. My favorite so far.</td>', 'This is a very nice image. The sepia works great with both subjects. Nice light and composition. My favorite so far.', '2003-10-16 12:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(452551, 42001, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the flower and the metal. The brilliant color of the flower really make it pop out at you.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the flower and the metal. The brilliant color of the flower really make it pop out at you.', '2003-10-16 12:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(452552, 42322, 6845, '<td valign="top">The image seems really blury. The image might have also benefited from a tighter crop.</td>', 'The image seems really blury. The image might have also benefited from a tighter crop.', '2003-10-16 12:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(452554, 42142, 6845, '<td valign="top">The background, for me, is too busy and takes away from the main subjects. Great color in the jars though.</td>', 'The background, for me, is too busy and takes away from the main subjects. Great color in the jars though.', '2003-10-16 12:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(452555, 42307, 6845, '<td valign="top">A very nice, simple, yet effective image. I like it.</td>', 'A very nice, simple, yet effective image. I like it.', '2003-10-16 12:37:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(452557, 42109, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a cool image. Almost looks like lightning. Nice composition.</td>', 'This is a cool image. Almost looks like lightning. Nice composition.', '2003-10-16 12:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(452560, 41812, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the ghostly look of the image.</td>', 'I like the ghostly look of the image.', '2003-10-16 12:39:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(452561, 42197, 6845, '<td valign="top">The only thing that I don''t like about this shot, is the tower being right in the middle of the image. I would perfer it off to one side or the other.</td>', 'The only thing that I don''t like about this shot, is the tower being right in the middle of the image. I would perfer it off to one side or the other.', '2003-10-16 12:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(452562, 41537, 6845, '<td valign="top">Very interesing. I like the color and the composition.</td>', 'Very interesing. I like the color and the composition.', '2003-10-16 12:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(452563, 41863, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the angle of view. It does seem a little too busy for me though.</td>', 'I like the angle of view. It does seem a little too busy for me though.', '2003-10-16 12:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(452564, 41599, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. I love the colors. very interesting to look at and study.</td>', 'This is a great shot. I love the colors. very interesting to look at and study.', '2003-10-16 12:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(452565, 42167, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the composition of the image. The hand and the dish really pop out at you. I personally might have liked to have seen a tighter cropped version of this shot. But then again, maybe not.</td>', 'I like the composition of the image. The hand and the dish really pop out at you. I personally might have liked to have seen a tighter cropped version of this shot. But then again, maybe not.', '2003-10-16 12:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(452566, 41831, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the subject. The tones and colors are very pleasing.</td>', 'I like the composition and the subject. The tones and colors are very pleasing.', '2003-10-16 12:45:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(452569, 42128, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the image. Could almost be an add for Ford. The one thing I think I would change, however, Is I would crop in tighter from the right and eliminate the shelves. They draw a little too much attention from the main subject. I like the high contrast look that is achieved by the bright light as well.</td>', 'I like the image. Could almost be an add for Ford. The one thing I think I would change, however, Is I would crop in tighter from the right and eliminate the shelves. They draw a little too much attention from the main subject. I like the high contrast look that is achieved by the bright light as well.', '2003-10-16 12:49:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(452571, 41951, 6845, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t move those tree in the background. That would really make it easier to see the main subjects. Nice composition.</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t move those tree in the background. That would really make it easier to see the main subjects. Nice composition.', '2003-10-16 12:50:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(452574, 42293, 6845, '<td valign="top">A very nice graphic image. I like it alot.</td>', 'A very nice graphic image. I like it alot.', '2003-10-16 12:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(452575, 42327, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the high key light of this image. It gives it a certain feel. Nice dof in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the high key light of this image. It gives it a certain feel. Nice dof in my opinion.', '2003-10-16 12:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(452578, 42285, 6845, '<td valign="top">The light is a bit too harsh and the composition seems a little too busy. I like the idea and the subject, I would have just liked to seen it presented a little different.</td>', 'The light is a bit too harsh and the composition seems a little too busy. I like the idea and the subject, I would have just liked to seen it presented a little different.', '2003-10-16 12:55:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(452582, 42186, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. I like the look on the childs face.</td>', 'Nice composition. I like the look on the childs face.', '2003-10-16 12:56:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(452585, 42259, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice frozen motion. I go back and forth on the background. It seems to busy and distracting, but then it also adds and element that says in the tub fun.</td>', 'Nice frozen motion. I go back and forth on the background. It seems to busy and distracting, but then it also adds and element that says in the tub fun.', '2003-10-16 12:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(452588, 42269, 6845, '<td valign="top">This makes my eyes hurt. Good macro shot.</td>', 'This makes my eyes hurt. Good macro shot.', '2003-10-16 12:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(452589, 42241, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but the colors seem a little dull. Next time try to point a light source through the jars from behind and off to the side, trying to light up the liquid but not have the light in the shot.</td>', 'I like the composition, but the colors seem a little dull. Next time try to point a light source through the jars from behind and off to the side, trying to light up the liquid but not have the light in the shot.', '2003-10-16 13:01:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(452592, 42083, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice repetition. It makes for a nice graphic image.</td>', 'Nice repetition. It makes for a nice graphic image.', '2003-10-16 13:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(452593, 41833, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like the subject and the light making the shadow. It makes a nice graphic element for the shot.</td>', 'I really like the subject and the light making the shadow. It makes a nice graphic element for the shot.', '2003-10-16 13:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(452594, 42320, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice image. Seems a little blurry though.</td>', 'Nice image. Seems a little blurry though.', '2003-10-16 13:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(452596, 42172, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the colors.</td>', 'I like the composition and the colors.', '2003-10-16 13:04:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(452597, 42306, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the composition.</td>', 'I like the idea and the composition.', '2003-10-16 13:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(452599, 41884, 6845, '<td valign="top">Ouch. Good composition. Nice light.</td>', 'Ouch. Good composition. Nice light.', '2003-10-16 13:05:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(452603, 42130, 6845, '<td valign="top">This is definately on of the sharpest images with this subject. I also find it to be one of the more visual appealing. Nice conposition.</td>', 'This is definately on of the sharpest images with this subject. I also find it to be one of the more visual appealing. Nice conposition.', '2003-10-16 13:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(452605, 42209, 6845, '<td valign="top">Other than the tilted and centered horizon, I really like this shot. It has a nice mood and feel to it.</td>', 'Other than the tilted and centered horizon, I really like this shot. It has a nice mood and feel to it.', '2003-10-16 13:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(452606, 42274, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the angle. Nice light too.</td>', 'I like the composition and the angle. Nice light too.', '2003-10-16 13:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(452607, 41543, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. The light seems realy harsh though.</td>', 'Nice composition. The light seems realy harsh though.', '2003-10-16 13:09:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(452611, 42298, 6845, '<td valign="top">The busy background take away from the subject. I almost would have liked to seen more motion blur as well.</td>', 'The busy background take away from the subject. I almost would have liked to seen more motion blur as well.', '2003-10-16 13:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(452613, 41620, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the composition ans the angle. It makes a nice graphic.</td>', 'I like the composition ans the angle. It makes a nice graphic.', '2003-10-16 13:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(452615, 42227, 6845, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what most people will think of this, but I really like it. Very simple but very effective. Perfect little drops of water.  This is a great way to present water as a subject.</td>', 'I don''t know what most people will think of this, but I really like it. Very simple but very effective. Perfect little drops of water.  This is a great way to present water as a subject.', '2003-10-16 13:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(452616, 42263, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the graphic that the subject creates. I also like your limited dof.</td>', 'I like the graphic that the subject creates. I also like your limited dof.', '2003-10-16 13:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
