(452960, 42330, 11184, '<td valign="top">Rather than just some tools sitting there to fit the theme, as most submissions chose to do, perhaps trying to tell the story more of who is using them or why would give more of a clear ''feeling'' of science.  Only a couple of submissions really tried to do that and had much more impact.  This could be ''maps'' theme, hiking, mountanclimbing, directions...you probably wouldn''t think science unless you knew before hand.</td>', 'Rather than just some tools sitting there to fit the theme, as most submissions chose to do, perhaps trying to tell the story more of who is using them or why would give more of a clear ''feeling'' of science.  Only a couple of submissions really tried to do that and had much more impact.  This could be ''maps'' theme, hiking, mountanclimbing, directions...you probably wouldn''t think science unless you knew before hand.', '2003-10-16 17:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(452961, 42202, 11184, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.....for a gambling, luck, or yahtzee theme.  As it is the only thing that really communicates science is the title.  Cool shot though.</td>', 'I really like this shot.....for a gambling, luck, or yahtzee theme.  As it is the only thing that really communicates science is the title.  Cool shot though.', '2003-10-16 17:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
