(452990, 42355, 11184, '<td valign="top">I am torn on this one.  I really like it, especially the drop and the way you shadowed out the rest..and, of course, the background.  Its the real impact of the photo, but very digital art looking and am wondering how you could have created it while staying within the submission rules.</td>', 'I am torn on this one.  I really like it, especially the drop and the way you shadowed out the rest..and, of course, the background.  Its the real impact of the photo, but very digital art looking and am wondering how you could have created it while staying within the submission rules.', '2003-10-16 18:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
