(453304, 42269, 11738, '<td valign="top">Ooo.  That looks painful.  I hope it wasn''t something too serious and that there was full recovery.</td>', 'Ooo.  That looks painful.  I hope it wasn''t something too serious and that there was full recovery.', '2003-10-16 22:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(453310, 41543, 11738, '<td valign="top">Decent bug shot but overexposed.  Shooting the little guy from another angle might have eliminated the glare on the wing and the eye.  Almost looks like you used a direct flash, which is almost always too harsh.</td>', 'Decent bug shot but overexposed.  Shooting the little guy from another angle might have eliminated the glare on the wing and the eye.  Almost looks like you used a direct flash, which is almost always too harsh.', '2003-10-16 22:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
