(453350, 42349, 11241, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot....Love the color and how sharp the image is.....One of my top photos....10</td>', 'Very nice shot....Love the color and how sharp the image is.....One of my top photos....10', '2003-10-16 23:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
