(453727, 41539, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice background and composition. Sometimes I am unsure how best to use DOF in an image and that is true of this one. I would like to see this one again with the closest crystal in focus to see how they compare.</td>', 'Nice background and composition. Sometimes I am unsure how best to use DOF in an image and that is true of this one. I would like to see this one again with the closest crystal in focus to see how they compare.', '2003-10-17 11:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
