(454041, 42151, 12327, '<td valign="top">pretty neat idea.  I think this would look even more dramatic if you could get an even closer shot or tighter cropping..  You''d have to do something to increase your DOF, but that looks great.  Actually it looks like you should have been closer to it because it looks like focus is on the corner of the chip that is closer... you should set it so the focus is in the middle of the chip,  then the whole thing would be in focus</td>', 'pretty neat idea.  I think this would look even more dramatic if you could get an even closer shot or tighter cropping..  You''d have to do something to increase your DOF, but that looks great.  Actually it looks like you should have been closer to it because it looks like focus is on the corner of the chip that is closer... you should set it so the focus is in the middle of the chip,  then the whole thing would be in focus', '2003-10-17 17:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(454042, 42141, 12421, '<td valign="top">Hey!  How''d did you train him to applaud?   Great shot!</td>', 'Hey!  How''d did you train him to applaud?   Great shot!', '2003-10-17 17:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
