(454053, 42285, 12327, '<td valign="top">yeah... in those days they made things to last... look at those huge wheels and the weigt of one of those... ayayay...  good capture</td>', 'yeah... in those days they made things to last... look at those huge wheels and the weigt of one of those... ayayay...  good capture', '2003-10-17 17:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
