(454056, 42355, 12327, '<td valign="top">yikes... I absolutelly hate needles...  which is why I can''t remember the last time I''ve been in a hospital.</td>', 'yikes... I absolutelly hate needles...  which is why I can''t remember the last time I''ve been in a hospital.', '2003-10-17 17:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
