(454063, 42354, 12327, '<td valign="top">I woulda put a black cloth over those stove controls in the background,  I like the teapot by itself against a dark background better.  Actually it wouldn''t have to sit on the stove at all for this photo.</td>', 'I woulda put a black cloth over those stove controls in the background,  I like the teapot by itself against a dark background better.  Actually it wouldn''t have to sit on the stove at all for this photo.', '2003-10-17 17:58:14.000000', NULL, 1),
