(454071, 42159, 12327, '<td valign="top">I think it''s a little too busy but very interesting... how did you create some of those effects without editing?    I''m dyin to know how you did this.</td>', 'I think it''s a little too busy but very interesting... how did you create some of those effects without editing?    I''m dyin to know how you did this.', '2003-10-17 18:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
