(454443, 42259, 9441, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot!  Great idea...and wonderful capture...I love the water!</td>', 'very interesting shot!  Great idea...and wonderful capture...I love the water!', '2003-10-18 03:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(454449, 42259, 11923, '<td valign="top">Great fun example of displacement.  At first I didn''t get the connection, but luckily I''d recently seen something on PBS about Archimedes.    Everything looks good, my only wish would be that the duck have a bit more light on it.  8</td>', 'Great fun example of displacement.  At first I didn''t get the connection, but luckily I''d recently seen something on PBS about Archimedes.    Everything looks good, my only wish would be that the duck have a bit more light on it.  8', '2003-10-18 03:50:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(454450, 42270, 11923, '<td valign="top">I got a chuckle out of this one.  Would''ve liked more of the apple showing, so it was more apparent that was what was being made green.  Also seems to have a soft focus throughout the photo, since the hypodermic and the apple are the main subject, I think they should both be in sharper focus.  Funny idea, a bit of a poke fun at science in my estimation.  I like the originality.  6</td>', 'I got a chuckle out of this one.  Would''ve liked more of the apple showing, so it was more apparent that was what was being made green.  Also seems to have a soft focus throughout the photo, since the hypodermic and the apple are the main subject, I think they should both be in sharper focus.  Funny idea, a bit of a poke fun at science in my estimation.  I like the originality.  6', '2003-10-18 03:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(454453, 42167, 11923, '<td valign="top">One of the nicer ''science lab'' photos.  I definitely like the range of colors, brings additional interest.  The lighting looks good - sterile and cold, fits the general idea of labs.  Good title - anything with E.coli gets my attention!  The action with the hand and the pointer thingie adds movement and additional story.  Well done.  8</td>', 'One of the nicer ''science lab'' photos.  I definitely like the range of colors, brings additional interest.  The lighting looks good - sterile and cold, fits the general idea of labs.  Good title - anything with E.coli gets my attention!  The action with the hand and the pointer thingie adds movement and additional story.  Well done.  8', '2003-10-18 03:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(454454, 42140, 11923, '<td valign="top">I think the vivid colors are gorgeous, focus and lighting are good.  The only thing I don''t like about the image is that it doesn''t say science to me - without the title it just looks like a (pretty) cd.  7</td>', 'I think the vivid colors are gorgeous, focus and lighting are good.  The only thing I don''t like about the image is that it doesn''t say science to me - without the title it just looks like a (pretty) cd.  7', '2003-10-18 03:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(454455, 42318, 11923, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  I like the lighting on the blue (thunderegg?) and the clear/white crystal.  Its a bit harsh on the silvery looking rock.  I like the way the items reflect and these against a pure black background really adds pop.  A suggestion might be to put the blue rock where the white one is, and have the white one more in the foreground.   The blue in the one rock is very vivid and nice, but it positioned where it is, leads my eye out of the photo, a slight rearrangement might still keep the brilliant white crystal as a focus but allow for full impact of the blue.  7</td>', 'Good subject.  I like the lighting on the blue (thunderegg?) and the clear/white crystal.  Its a bit harsh on the silvery looking rock.  I like the way the items reflect and these against a pure black background really adds pop.  A suggestion might be to put the blue rock where the white one is, and have the white one more in the foreground.   The blue in the one rock is very vivid and nice, but it positioned where it is, leads my eye out of the photo, a slight rearrangement might still keep the brilliant white crystal as a focus but allow for full impact of the blue.  7', '2003-10-18 04:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(454456, 42241, 11923, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, the varying heights add interest.  I like it against the plain white, really brings out the colors.  Since the eyedropper is the closest item, I think it''d look better if it was totally in focus, it gets soft towards the black end.  One other suggestion would be to have either back beaker that''s filled with green have yellow in it and then keep the eyedropper with the green, or vice versa.  Might add more depth and if you were to go with the former it would add in the ''mixing of primary color'' aspect.  Just a thought.  Otherwise a nice solid shot.  7</td>', 'Nice composition, the varying heights add interest.  I like it against the plain white, really brings out the colors.  Since the eyedropper is the closest item, I think it''d look better if it was totally in focus, it gets soft towards the black end.  One other suggestion would be to have either back beaker that''s filled with green have yellow in it and then keep the eyedropper with the green, or vice versa.  Might add more depth and if you were to go with the former it would add in the ''mixing of primary color'' aspect.  Just a thought.  Otherwise a nice solid shot.  7', '2003-10-18 04:06:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(454457, 41463, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure if this is in the right challenge to be honest, the title makes me think its for the alone one.  That said, its a nice black &amp; white - unfortunately the size makes it difficult to determine details.  The swan is very tiny and almost gets lost.  If there is a larger version of this I''d love to see it.  Lighting looks like it was good, subject has a nice dramatic air to it with the mist.  I can''t tell if those are bushes in the foreground or just strange reflection - either way its a tad distracting.  Gave a 4, might have done better if the size was bigger, I couldn''t see the science connection clearly either.</td>', 'I''m not sure if this is in the right challenge to be honest, the title makes me think its for the alone one.  That said, its a nice black & white - unfortunately the size makes it difficult to determine details.  The swan is very tiny and almost gets lost.  If there is a larger version of this I''d love to see it.  Lighting looks like it was good, subject has a nice dramatic air to it with the mist.  I can''t tell if those are bushes in the foreground or just strange reflection - either way its a tad distracting.  Gave a 4, might have done better if the size was bigger, I couldn''t see the science connection clearly either.', '2003-10-18 04:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(454458, 41863, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very nice set up.  Not overly busy, good lighting.  Most important aspects are well focused.  This truly says ''entomology'' to me.  Clean photo, I like the human addition with the hand, keeps it from being a boring cold image of bug science.  :)  7</td>', 'Very nice set up.  Not overly busy, good lighting.  Most important aspects are well focused.  This truly says ''entomology'' to me.  Clean photo, I like the human addition with the hand, keeps it from being a boring cold image of bug science.  :)  7', '2003-10-18 04:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(454463, 42299, 8891, '<td valign="top">This is a very well taken shot....I got a problem with the hand holding the watch to show the tme....just don''t find it necessary</td>', 'This is a very well taken shot....I got a problem with the hand holding the watch to show the tme....just don''t find it necessary', '2003-10-18 04:28:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(454466, 41917, 10170, '<td valign="top">I''m really not sure what this has to do with science, but it is a lovely shot.</td>', 'I''m really not sure what this has to do with science, but it is a lovely shot.', '2003-10-18 05:13:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(454467, 42227, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very clever indeed.</td>', 'Very clever indeed.', '2003-10-18 05:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(454468, 42312, 10170, '<td valign="top">Focus could be sharper.</td>', 'Focus could be sharper.', '2003-10-18 05:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(454469, 42333, 10170, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but the speckles on the black I find distract from it.  Having said that, I always have the same problem with black backgrounds.</td>', 'I like this photo, but the speckles on the black I find distract from it.  Having said that, I always have the same problem with black backgrounds.', '2003-10-18 05:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(454470, 42202, 10170, '<td valign="top">Not sure this is really science, more chance with a bit of mathematics.  However, I really like the photo.</td>', 'Not sure this is really science, more chance with a bit of mathematics.  However, I really like the photo.', '2003-10-18 05:42:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(454471, 42299, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done indeed.  Darwin is definitely the person I would choose to meet were I given the choice of anyone in history.  Love the lighting/colour here.</td>', 'Very nicely done indeed.  Darwin is definitely the person I would choose to meet were I given the choice of anyone in history.  Love the lighting/colour here.', '2003-10-18 05:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(454472, 42035, 10170, '<td valign="top">Very beautifully done.  I think it may have been a little better with a sepia tone with slightly less orange tinge to it though.</td>', 'Very beautifully done.  I think it may have been a little better with a sepia tone with slightly less orange tinge to it though.', '2003-10-18 05:48:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(454474, 41831, 10170, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but I really can''t see any link here to science, without really over stretching the bow.  I may well have just missed it.  If you care to explain it I''ll revote.<br/> <br/>It''s a shame, as it is a lovely photo, so I am hoping I''ve missed something.</td>', 'Sorry, but I really can''t see any link here to science, without really over stretching the bow.  I may well have just missed it.  If you care to explain it I''ll revote. It''s a shame, as it is a lovely photo, so I am hoping I''ve missed something.', '2003-10-18 05:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(454491, 42187, 13296, '<td valign="top">Adding the word "Study" to something really doesn''t make it science.  Shame, as otherwise this was a decent shot.</td>', 'Adding the word "Study" to something really doesn''t make it science.  Shame, as otherwise this was a decent shot.', '2003-10-18 07:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
