(454493, 41463, 13296, '<td valign="top">Science????????????????  Only if about 95% of anything is classed at such.  Glad you mentioned it was a swan as well as I can''t make it out.</td>', 'Science????????????????  Only if about 95% of anything is classed at such.  Glad you mentioned it was a swan as well as I can''t make it out.', '2003-10-18 07:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
