(454589, 42333, 4210, '<td valign="top">This photo could have benefittedfrom the rule of thirds. By having the flower centered smack in the middle, there is too much black all around it.</td>', 'This photo could have benefittedfrom the rule of thirds. By having the flower centered smack in the middle, there is too much black all around it.', '2003-10-18 12:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
