(455980, 42035, 11111, '<td valign="top">This is #1, to me. Can''t improve a thing about it. Love the concept.</td>', 'This is #1, to me. Can''t improve a thing about it. Love the concept.', '2003-10-20 12:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(455983, 41460, 13047, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, though I think for this particular challenge, a mild fill flash of some sort would have accentuated the form of the study. Also, I think a full body shot would have better conveyed the "science" theme. All in all, I like your approach to this challenge.</td>', 'Composition is good, though I think for this particular challenge, a mild fill flash of some sort would have accentuated the form of the study. Also, I think a full body shot would have better conveyed the "science" theme. All in all, I like your approach to this challenge.', '2003-10-20 12:25:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(455994, 42095, 13047, '<td valign="top">I think this is a decent image overall, but I find the "Clairol" box rather distracting.</td>', 'I think this is a decent image overall, but I find the "Clairol" box rather distracting.', '2003-10-20 12:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(456013, 42309, 13047, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo! If I did have to change anything it would be first, to exclude the blue thing in the upper right portion of the photo. It''s compositionally distracting, and it''s dull color contrasts sharply with the brilliant color in the rest of the image. Second, I''d shift the subject to the right just a bit to force viewers to follow an extended "eye path" to the primary subject. I give this photo a 7</td>', 'Awesome photo! If I did have to change anything it would be first, to exclude the blue thing in the upper right portion of the photo. It''s compositionally distracting, and it''s dull color contrasts sharply with the brilliant color in the rest of the image. Second, I''d shift the subject to the right just a bit to force viewers to follow an extended "eye path" to the primary subject. I give this photo a 7', '2003-10-20 12:50:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(456020, 41811, 3569, '<td valign="top">Excellent in all ways.. Great shot.</td>', 'Excellent in all ways.. Great shot.', '2003-10-20 13:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(456023, 41437, 3569, '<td valign="top">Kind of uninteresting subject, especially at the angle you took.</td>', 'Kind of uninteresting subject, especially at the angle you took.', '2003-10-20 13:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(456028, 42330, 13047, '<td valign="top">I really dig your approach to this challenge. I do however, feel that the use of both the GPS and  the compass is a bit redundant. Perhaps a magnifying glass could be substituted for the compass? I think also, a bit of shadow cast from the GPS would have given the image some depth.</td>', 'I really dig your approach to this challenge. I do however, feel that the use of both the GPS and  the compass is a bit redundant. Perhaps a magnifying glass could be substituted for the compass? I think also, a bit of shadow cast from the GPS would have given the image some depth.', '2003-10-20 13:09:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(456030, 41863, 3569, '<td valign="top">Ah yes, reminds me of my insect taxonomy days.  Good interpretation.</td>', 'Ah yes, reminds me of my insect taxonomy days.  Good interpretation.', '2003-10-20 13:09:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(456032, 41462, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice coloras and contrasts</td>', 'Nice coloras and contrasts', '2003-10-20 13:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(456038, 41759, 13047, '<td valign="top">I think  that the inclusion of the entire wing would have made this photo a serious contender for one of the ribbons. Aside from that, it''s a rather impressive photo.</td>', 'I think  that the inclusion of the entire wing would have made this photo a serious contender for one of the ribbons. Aside from that, it''s a rather impressive photo.', '2003-10-20 13:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(456044, 42349, 9441, '<td valign="top">awesome blue color, love the clarity!  Nice job.</td>', 'awesome blue color, love the clarity!  Nice job.', '2003-10-20 13:16:37.000000', NULL, 1),
