(456181, 42222, 4753, '<td valign="top">haha every scientist''s office looks like that.  oh i could swear that looks like my advisor''s office.</td>', 'haha every scientist''s office looks like that.  oh i could swear that looks like my advisor''s office.', '2003-10-20 15:01:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(456182, 41462, 6008, '<td valign="top">Good control of dof to blur the background. I think this background works better than if you had had a plain background, it has more impact this way. The instruments in the foreground are nicely sharp, and the liquid color is a nice contrast to the blue. The test tube looks a little streaky/dirty, but it was likely your 13th shot or something and it doesnt distract too much. Shooting glass is difficult and you handled light glare very well.</td>', 'Good control of dof to blur the background. I think this background works better than if you had had a plain background, it has more impact this way. The instruments in the foreground are nicely sharp, and the liquid color is a nice contrast to the blue. The test tube looks a little streaky/dirty, but it was likely your 13th shot or something and it doesnt distract too much. Shooting glass is difficult and you handled light glare very well.', '2003-10-20 15:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(456183, 41833, 4753, '<td valign="top">wow.  very cool shot.  the shadows really make it.</td>', 'wow.  very cool shot.  the shadows really make it.', '2003-10-20 15:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(456186, 42173, 6008, '<td valign="top">The lighting here is good, and it enhances the colored liquids well. Not sure about the hand, it adds a different aspect to the shot that could have been boring without it, but I also wonder as to what purpose it serves in the shot too, other than possibly hiding the light source. The green bottle is differentand appealing, and certainly a change from the beakers. The bottles/beakers look quite sharp and are quite effective. Of all the beaker-type shots this is my favorite.</td>', 'The lighting here is good, and it enhances the colored liquids well. Not sure about the hand, it adds a different aspect to the shot that could have been boring without it, but I also wonder as to what purpose it serves in the shot too, other than possibly hiding the light source. The green bottle is differentand appealing, and certainly a change from the beakers. The bottles/beakers look quite sharp and are quite effective. Of all the beaker-type shots this is my favorite.', '2003-10-20 15:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(456187, 42159, 6008, '<td valign="top">There is certainly a lot of color and light in this image. I have no idea what it is, but it doesnt really matter as it seems nicely abstract. For the most part things look sharp and clean. It is certainly visually appealing.</td>', 'There is certainly a lot of color and light in this image. I have no idea what it is, but it doesnt really matter as it seems nicely abstract. For the most part things look sharp and clean. It is certainly visually appealing.', '2003-10-20 15:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(456189, 41978, 6008, '<td valign="top">This has to be the funniest photo of the image. The light and focus on the microscope is good, and compositionally well placed. Of course it is the photograph under the microscope that makes this stand out. Not only is it funny but it also makes an interesting statement, as well as a scary thought about what could be seen while looking through it. At first glance it''s a little bland, but I think it certainly makes up for it by being clever and humorous. Something I could certainly see in advertising.</td>', 'This has to be the funniest photo of the image. The light and focus on the microscope is good, and compositionally well placed. Of course it is the photograph under the microscope that makes this stand out. Not only is it funny but it also makes an interesting statement, as well as a scary thought about what could be seen while looking through it. At first glance it''s a little bland, but I think it certainly makes up for it by being clever and humorous. Something I could certainly see in advertising.', '2003-10-20 15:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(456190, 41863, 6008, '<td valign="top">Compositionally this is good, it has all the elements associated with the subject and all nicely placed. The hand gives it a nice dimension of being just a little bit more than a still life. I can certainly see science in this image. The lighting is good and the image is clean. It may appeal more to those who have an interest in entomology, but it is still a well-captured image.</td>', 'Compositionally this is good, it has all the elements associated with the subject and all nicely placed. The hand gives it a nice dimension of being just a little bit more than a still life. I can certainly see science in this image. The lighting is good and the image is clean. It may appeal more to those who have an interest in entomology, but it is still a well-captured image.', '2003-10-20 15:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(456195, 42265, 11111, '<td valign="top">Well composed work you''ve done here. Screams out science to me. Very nice lighting as well.</td>', 'Well composed work you''ve done here. Screams out science to me. Very nice lighting as well.', '2003-10-20 15:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(456198, 41978, 12602, '<td valign="top">need a microscope to find it huh????</td>', 'need a microscope to find it huh????', '2003-10-20 15:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(456203, 41541, 12661, '<td valign="top">Defying gravity??? Heck, if it wasn''t for gravity, that top would should right out to outerspace. It''s the gravity that''s keeping in balance with the magnetic field!!! OK. Time to stop being a smartass. Nice framing and cropping. An excellent choice for this challenge. The only downside is that the top is slightly blurred, probably due to the wobble. Using more light and less aperture could have sharpened it. But overall, it doesn''t take much away from the photo. Kudos.</td>', 'Defying gravity??? Heck, if it wasn''t for gravity, that top would should right out to outerspace. It''s the gravity that''s keeping in balance with the magnetic field!!! OK. Time to stop being a smartass. Nice framing and cropping. An excellent choice for this challenge. The only downside is that the top is slightly blurred, probably due to the wobble. Using more light and less aperture could have sharpened it. But overall, it doesn''t take much away from the photo. Kudos.', '2003-10-20 15:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(456204, 42226, 10858, '<td valign="top">I would have turned the order of the contrast and the blur. I like the subject, but maybe it''s a bit simple.</td>', 'I would have turned the order of the contrast and the blur. I like the subject, but maybe it''s a bit simple.', '2003-10-20 16:08:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(456205, 42273, 10858, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I don''t feel the science in it so strong.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I don''t feel the science in it so strong.', '2003-10-20 16:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
