(456207, 42040, 10858, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, I like it, but maybe an outshot from inside would have more impact.</td>', 'Very good idea, I like it, but maybe an outshot from inside would have more impact.', '2003-10-20 16:10:09.000000', NULL, 1),
