(456270, 41769, 13388, '<td valign="top">It should be a bit sharper, maybe focusing isn''t proper, or what? Lights are OK, but the background should be more homogenic. Appleing that apple, that''s a great idea, i love it. ;&gt;</td>', 'It should be a bit sharper, maybe focusing isn''t proper, or what? Lights are OK, but the background should be more homogenic. Appleing that apple, that''s a great idea, i love it. ;>', '2003-10-20 18:49:04.000000', NULL, 1),
