(456297, 42222, 12388, '<td valign="top">I like how the color is. It gives it that old-timey look, along with the messy book shelf.</td>', 'I like how the color is. It gives it that old-timey look, along with the messy book shelf.', '2003-10-20 19:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
