(456310, 41541, 8860, '<td valign="top">I''d like to have seen much less of the base unit and more of the top with some sense of space above it. I like these toys and was going to get one - looks fun. I think some more dramatic directional lighting would be good and faster shutter speed would help too. Or slow it down so that the top is even more blurred showing the action.</td>', 'I''d like to have seen much less of the base unit and more of the top with some sense of space above it. I like these toys and was going to get one - looks fun. I think some more dramatic directional lighting would be good and faster shutter speed would help too. Or slow it down so that the top is even more blurred showing the action.', '2003-10-20 19:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(456341, 41831, 11738, '<td valign="top">Ummm... I have looked at this picture all week and cannot figure how it relates to Science.  Very nice picture, but no strong relation to topic, so it gets a lower score from me.</td>', 'Ummm... I have looked at this picture all week and cannot figure how it relates to Science.  Very nice picture, but no strong relation to topic, so it gets a lower score from me.', '2003-10-20 20:03:20.000000', NULL, 1),
