(456980, 42275, 6870, '<td valign="top">Fun image! I like your front-on point of view. I would suggest just darkening it just a little, and bringing up the contrast. This will saturate your colors more, and generally make it more vibrant.</td>', 'Fun image! I like your front-on point of view. I would suggest just darkening it just a little, and bringing up the contrast. This will saturate your colors more, and generally make it more vibrant.', '2003-10-21 16:35:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(456983, 42205, 6870, '<td valign="top">What a great idea! the clarity suffers here; I kind of expect light to be pure and vibrant. Try using brightness/contrast to darken the neutral colors and bring up the the vibrant colors. You can increase the saturation of the colors, too. Really top notch composition, too.</td>', 'What a great idea! the clarity suffers here; I kind of expect light to be pure and vibrant. Try using brightness/contrast to darken the neutral colors and bring up the the vibrant colors. You can increase the saturation of the colors, too. Really top notch composition, too.', '2003-10-21 16:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
