(457119, 42312, 8860, '<td valign="top">Image looks quite distorted through the noisy effect. I''m sure that''s deliberate but I think you really need to go the whole distance and try to use more dynamic composition and background. Perhaps the pills should have completely covered all signs of a background, or maybe they could have been arranged more interestingly (stacked?). The colours are good but the image quality lets it down.</td>', 'Image looks quite distorted through the noisy effect. I''m sure that''s deliberate but I think you really need to go the whole distance and try to use more dynamic composition and background. Perhaps the pills should have completely covered all signs of a background, or maybe they could have been arranged more interestingly (stacked?). The colours are good but the image quality lets it down.', '2003-10-21 19:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
