(457628, 42097, 9780, '<td valign="top">This picture was taken in a litle harse. Firstly the camera had to reflect on the old kind of a harddrive to show that even the camera is smaller then harddrive. Reflection of me is just for the fun and to remind people that they are even smaller than first kind of harddrives.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-22 03:44:38.</i></td>', 'This picture was taken in a litle harse. Firstly the camera had to reflect on the old kind of a harddrive to show that even the camera is smaller then harddrive. Reflection of me is just for the fun and to remind people that they are even smaller than first kind of harddrives.', '2003-10-22 04:44:02.000000', '2003-10-22 04:44:38.000000', 0),
(457663, 42227, 7263, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kiwiness:</b></div><hr/><i> If you are anywhere near here today, come on over the beer is on me. Thanx thanx thanx, I love this game :-)</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hell if that''s an invite to New Zealand, I''m on my way! ;)<br/> <br/>I am pretty tight with my 10''s, but most of your pictures always seem to get it from me, which pleases me heaps. Your on a roll!</td>', 'Originally posted by kiwiness: If you are anywhere near here today, come on over the beer is on me. Thanx thanx thanx, I love this game :-)  Hell if that''s an invite to New Zealand, I''m on my way! ;) I am pretty tight with my 10''s, but most of your pictures always seem to get it from me, which pleases me heaps. Your on a roll!', '2003-10-22 05:09:04.000000', NULL, 0),
