(457877, 42312, 11096, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your great comments.  Just so you know I submitted the wrong version of this photo.  I guess that is what happens when you submit at the last minute.  The version I meant to submit was much more in focus and was from a little different angle.  Oh well, maybe next time.</td>', 'Thanks for all your great comments.  Just so you know I submitted the wrong version of this photo.  I guess that is what happens when you submit at the last minute.  The version I meant to submit was much more in focus and was from a little different angle.  Oh well, maybe next time.', '2003-10-22 09:38:21.000000', NULL, 0),
