(458298, 42227, 3290, '<td valign="top">Well. Two blue ribbons on the front page at once. And your work is of such a consistently high standard - it really deserves it. I''ve said it before - my hat''s off to you. But where do you get your ideas - have you made a pact with the devil? :-)<br/>Excellent work, well done.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-22 12:40:49.</i></td>', 'Well. Two blue ribbons on the front page at once. And your work is of such a consistently high standard - it really deserves it. I''ve said it before - my hat''s off to you. But where do you get your ideas - have you made a pact with the devil? :-)Excellent work, well done.', '2003-10-22 13:40:23.000000', '2003-10-22 13:40:49.000000', 0),
(458312, 42227, 11184, '<td valign="top">How in god''s name did you write that so perfectly?  I actually assumed it must have been some premade thing that just looked like water droplets.  The more I study it the more I just can''t believe that was hand done!  Heck, I''d have been impressd by the penmanship had it been written in pen, but those droplets are sized and spaced beyond perfection.  <br/>GOOD GOD MAN, your talent is absolutely demoralizing to the rest of us!  <br/></td>', 'How in god''s name did you write that so perfectly?  I actually assumed it must have been some premade thing that just looked like water droplets.  The more I study it the more I just can''t believe that was hand done!  Heck, I''d have been impressd by the penmanship had it been written in pen, but those droplets are sized and spaced beyond perfection.  GOOD GOD MAN, your talent is absolutely demoralizing to the rest of us!  ', '2003-10-22 13:52:42.000000', NULL, 0),
