(458473, 42035, 6165, '<td valign="top">Like I said about the color, purely a matter of personal taste. As you can see, everybody has a different one (taste that is :). From the scores, looks like everybody realized that anyhow and gave you great marks.<br/> <br/>It''s an excellent photo no matter how you decide to duotone it. Keep it up!</td>', 'Like I said about the color, purely a matter of personal taste. As you can see, everybody has a different one (taste that is :). From the scores, looks like everybody realized that anyhow and gave you great marks. It''s an excellent photo no matter how you decide to duotone it. Keep it up!', '2003-10-22 15:05:41.000000', NULL, 0),
